  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><em><strong>Forge/Fabric/Neoforge</strong><strong><br></strong></em></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>如果你使用 Minecraft Forge 1.19，請使用最新版本的 Forge，否則可能因投擲武器而崩潰。</em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">此模組新增了 10 種武器，可使用木頭、石頭、鐵、金和鑽石製作。武器可以升級為獄髓武器。</span><br><br>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>武器列表：</em></span><br>武士刀<br>匕首<br>長劍<br>巨劍<br>手斧<br>戰斧<br>巨斧<br>長矛<br>長柄刀<br>戟</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><em>特殊物品效果：</em></strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">匕首和手斧可以像三叉戟一樣投擲，並且也能獲得<em>忠誠</em>附魔。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><em>自訂材料配方：</em></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><em>木棍</em></strong> - 可在合成台中將 3 根木棍垂直放置來合成，用於製作巨斧和長柄武器。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/471/976/crafting-wooden-rod.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em><strong>武器配方：</strong></em></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">武士刀</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/471/982/katana-recipe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"242\" height=\"115\"></p>\n</div><p><br>匕首</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/471/983/dagger-recipe.png\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>長劍</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/471/984/longsword-recipe.png\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;<br>巨劍</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/471/985/greatsword-recipe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"242\" height=\"115\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>手斧</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/471/986/handaxe-recipe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"242\" height=\"115\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>戰斧</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/471/987/battleaxe-recipe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"242\" height=\"115\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>巨斧</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/471/988/greataxe-recipe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"242\" height=\"115\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>長矛</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/471/989/pike-recipe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"242\" height=\"115\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>長柄刀</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/471/990/glaive-recipe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"242\" height=\"115\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>戟</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/471/991/halberd-recipe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"242\" height=\"115\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.kinetichosting.net%252faff.php%253faff%253d320\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://jingames.net/dailymodder.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"316\"></a></p>",
